    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "small shifts... stillness... it sounds nice in theory but it doesnt actually stop the clock. it doesn't stop the weight. it's like trying to empty the ocean with a spoon. i'm just so weary of the struggle. does it ever just... stop on its own? or is it always supposed to be this hard? sometimes i feel like i've fought as hard as i can and i'm just not winning.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
