      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable to feel weary when the struggle feels endless, like fighting a tide with a spoon. The truth is, sometimes the fight itself becomes the most exhausting part of the experience. While nothing magically stops the world's relentless pace, giving yourself permission to simply *stop* fighting for a moment can sometimes be the most powerful thing you can do. You don't have to win every battle; sometimes survival is enough for today.",
      "source": "target",
